# 52. Exiting Emacs

To exit Emacs, use:

```text
C-x C-c
```

Meaning:

```text
Ctrl + x
Ctrl + c
```

If there are unsaved changes, Emacs asks whether you want to save them.

---

# 53. Exiting with Unsaved Changes

